/-!
# Assembly of the Turán/Hadamard proof of the other-character Deuring--Heilbronn phenomenon

This file reduces `Work.LinnikAreas.repelOtherNeDH` to two analytic inputs
(`TuranOther.TwUpperCore`, `TuranOther.TwMassCore`), Turán's power-sum theorem
(`Work.LinnikAreas.DhK.turanWeighted`) and the arithmetic `TuranOther.turanArith`.
